@baseUrl = http://localhost:6688/console

### Get All Payments
GET {{baseUrl}}/payments

### Get Single Payment
GET {{baseUrl}}/payments/1

### Create Payment
POST {{baseUrl}}/payments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount": 100.00,
  "currency": "USD",
  "method": "credit_card"
}

### Update Payment
PUT {{baseUrl}}/payments/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount": 150.00,
  "currency": "USD",
  "method": "paypal"
}

### Delete Payment
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/payments/1